manTask tickets only and FIX-004 is a normal corrective ticket with no other manual-close endpoint.\",\n  \"logFile\": null\n}\n```\n\n```json\n{\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-18T15:33:34.742Z\",\n  \"ticket\": \"GOV-002\",\n  \"event\": \"in_progress\",\n  \"runner\": \"claude\",\n  \"model\": \"claude-sonnet-5\",\n  \"message\": \"Execution launched via dashboard.\",\n  \"logFile\": null\n}\n```\n","numLines":137,"startLine":380,"totalLines":516}}}
